title: Media
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: media_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; media_timer += 6;
card-image: img/kcp_media.jpg
#subtitle: Media coverage wins elections.

= Media

The KCP does not control a vast media empire of the CNN which tends to be impartial but we still have some ways to spread out message such as smaller newspapers and sound bytes.

- @commercial
- @campaign
- @ideological
- @radio
- @radio_2
- @radio_3
- @radio_4
- @return: We should not do anything with media at the moment.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@commercial
title: Sell commercial books made by Annastasia.
subtitle: This might upset those who view such methods as ideaologicaly impure but it raises funds.
on-arrival: resources += 1; commercialized_media += 1; new_middle_spd += 4*(1 - dissent); old_middle_spd += 3*(1-dissent); left_dissent += 10; labor_dissent += 10

The novels Annastasia writes sell well but it is seen as making fun of the party by some or in other cases outright using corrupted funds on top of people acussing Annastasia of tightening her grip over the party using her control over the funds.

@campaign
title: The purpose of our newspapers and posters is to gain voters.
subtitle: Our media will focus on the electoral campaign.
on-arrival: campaign_media += 1; workers_spd += 4*(1 - dissent); unemployed_spd += 2*(1-dissent);

Our media is spreading our message. Nothing special here.

@ideological
title: We will have vibrant ideological debate at a stage.
subtitle: There will be space for all wings to air their views.
on-arrival: left_dissent -= 6; labor_dissent -= 6; center_dissent -= 6; reformist_dissent -= 6; neorevisionist_dissent -= 6

This is important to keep our big tent party together.

@radio
title: Why not fund a rival to CNN?
subtitle: -2 resources
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
view-if: radio = 0
on-arrival: radio += 1; resources -= 2; new_middle_spd += 4*(1 - dissent); old_middle_spd += 3*(1 - dissent); workers_spd += 2*(1 - dissent); labor_dissent += 5; socialism += 3*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 3*(1 - dissent) if pacifism > 1; pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent) if democratization > 1

Our new news station will allow for direct messaging to voters without any of the CNN impartiality.

@radio_2
title: We must keep on building up our radio network.
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
view-if: radio > 0 and radio <= 3
on-arrival: radio += 1; resources -= 1; new_middle_spd += 5*(1 - dissent); old_middle_spd += 3*(1 - dissent); workers_spd += 3*(1 - dissent); socialism += 3*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 3*(1 - dissent)*(pacifism-2) if pacifism > 2; pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent)*(democratization-2) if democratization > 2

Our media network has proven a sucess and is growing ever so slowly.

@radio_3
title: We must keep on building up our radio network.
subtitle: It is now financially self-sufficient, and does not require any more resources.
view-if: radio > 3 and radio <= 5 and year <= 1931
on-arrival: radio += 1; new_middle_spd += 5*(1 - dissent); old_middle_spd += 4*(1 - dissent); workers_spd += 4*(1 - dissent); rural_spd += 3*(1 - dissent); unemployed_spd += 2*(1-dissent); socialism += 3*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 3*(1 - dissent)*(pacifism-2) if pacifism > 2; pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent)*(democratization-2) if democratization > 2

Our media network has become a successful tool for spreading our message.

@radio_4
title: We should keep on supporting our radio network.
subtitle: As radio becomes more common, the novelty is beginning to wear off, and radio is becoming saturated in society. -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
view-if: radio > 3 and (radio >= 6 or year >= 1932) and radio <= 9
on-arrival: radio += 1; resources -= 1; new_middle_spd += 3*(1 - dissent); old_middle_spd += 2*(1 - dissent); workers_spd += 3*(1 - dissent); rural_spd += 2*(1 - dissent); unemployed_spd += 2*(1-dissent); socialism += 2*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 2*(1 - dissent)*(pacifism-2) if pacifism > 2; pro_republic += 2*(1-dissent)*(democratization-2) if democratization > 2

We are continuing to invest in our newspapers. However due to our occupation of the media space the CNN has stopped being impartial and the ongoing media war is making it harder for us to spread our message this way.
